<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Promote<sp/>examples<sp/>into<sp/>tests<sp/>when<sp/>behavior<sp/>stabilizes.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Result<sp/>codes</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`SattyreSolverResult`<sp/>maps<sp/>to<sp/>SAT,<sp/>UNSAT,<sp/>UNKNOWN.</highlight></codeline>
